      <!-- FAQ -->
      <div class="msf-seo-faq" id="toner-finder-faq">
        <h3 class="msf-seo-title">Toner Compatibility FAQs</h3>

        <details class="msf-seo-qa">
          <summary>Why might my toner not show up in the Finder?</summary>
          <div class="msf-seo-answer">
            Some listings share multiple part numbers, some models have regional variations, and availability can change. If you do not see it, email or call us with your printer model and toner part number.
